        "subject": "LU-20821 tests: skip OSS nodes without ost_io in cleanup_123aj",
        "message": "LU-20821 tests: skip OSS nodes without ost_io in cleanup_123aj\n\nCheck for nrs_policies before writing it,\nskip OSS nodes without ost_io in cleanup_123aj.\n\ncleanup_123aj() restores nrs_policies=fifo\non every OSS node returned by osts_nodes().\nIf an earlier test leaves only ost1 mounted,\nan OSS node with no active OST has no ost.OSS.ost_io device.\nThe set_param then returns non-zero and\nmarks an otherwise successful test_123aj as FAIL.\n\nCheck for nrs_policies before writing it\nand treat the per-node restore as best effort,\nmatching the existing best-effort MGS cleanup commands.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Xiyang Wang <xiwang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I7f28fe5156c266b5465eb750a5b08a0210bf4ec9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
